# Tencent Cloud lab delivery artifacts.
#
# The host-package archives (03-主机包/*.tar.gz) and OCI archives are large
# generated build outputs. They are kept on disk as frozen deployment
# artifacts (matching the RC1 delivery convention, which was never committed)
# and are recorded in git by their SHA-256 digests and evidence files instead.
# Small delivery metadata (manifests, SHA256SUMS, evidence JSON, READMEs) IS
# tracked.

packages/**/03-主机包/*.tar.gz
packages/**/images/*.oci.tar
oci/**/*.tar
